        <p>This report analyzes over 40,000 public mobile user reviews from the top 5 Generative AI applications: ChatGPT, Microsoft Copilot, Google Gemini, Perplexity, and Claude. The goal is to provide the product strategy team with actionable intelligence on user sentiment, pain points, and competitive positioning.</p>

        <h3>Top 3 Strategic Takeaways</h3>
